    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d824">

                <pb facs="0909" n="1743" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1743"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 652.119/1806</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The War Trade Board Representative in Cuba</hi>
                        (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Chief of the Division of Latin American Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stabler</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-08-14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 14, 1918</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received August 22.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Herbert</hi>: Referring to my letter of August 10, 1918, I
                    now have to inform you that I had a conversation with the Spanish Minister two
                    days ago in reference to bunkering the Spanish steamers at Porto Rico or some
                    other American port, and he advised me that he would telegraph his
                    recommendations to the Spanish Government, and hoped to receive a favorable
                    reply within a few days.</p>
                <p>As soon as I hear from him upon the subject I will at once let you know.</p>
                <p>Yours very sincerely,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">H. H. Morgan</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
